<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28751" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mĕrācus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		merus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>pure, unmixed</i>, esp. of wine (class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum meracius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 3, 31, 78</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">uva,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					2, 24</span></i>
			 (3, 31), 27.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of other things: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">helleborum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 2, 2, 137</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Pers. 4, 16</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">libertas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Rep. 1, 43, 66</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">meracissimus scientiae fons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 3, 10</span></i>
			.—Hence, adv.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mĕrācē</span></b> , <i>purely, without mixture</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">minus, sed meracius bibere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 1,
					3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rubere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 33, 18</span></i>
			.—<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">purius, meracius amare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 4, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
